WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:12.867
One window. Every agent.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.200
Describe the outcome.

3
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.700
PARALITH staffs the roster.

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.367
Direct the whole team at once.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.033
Every coding agent. One space.

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.200
Six agents, working at once.

7
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.700
One agent stops.

8
00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:56.033
One place tells you which.

9
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.867
Every change keeps its author.

10
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.867
Completion is a claim.

11
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.033
Evidence is not.

12
00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:18.033
The machine restarts.

13
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.200
The session does not.
